---
// Small Connect-blue pill with a white dot and an uppercase label that
// introduces a section of a Connect product page, such as "The smart
// home multi-tool".
//
// Built from the "Labels" component in the Figma file "Connect AUX-2"
// (instance 2586:1434), not ported from Jekyll. The label is written
// in sentence case and set in capitals by CSS, so screen readers do
// not spell it out.
---

<p class="connect-label"><slot /></p>

<style lang="scss">
  .connect-label {
    align-items: center;
    background: var(--color-connect-line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    color: var(--color-text-inverse);
    display: inline-flex;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: var(--font-size-small);
    font-weight: 700;
    gap: var(--space-small);
    line-height: 1;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0.375rem var(--space-large);
    text-transform: uppercase;

    &::before {
      background: currentColor;
      border-radius: 50%;
      content: "";
      height: 0.5rem;
      width: 0.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
